menu "MQTT adapter"

    config MINIHUB_MQTT_ADAPTER
        bool "Enable MQTT Hub adapter"
        depends on MINIHUB_MQTT_BROKER
        default y
        help
            MQTT client for the Hub's own broker. It connects to 127.0.0.1 on
            the port in adapters.mqtt_broker and carries the host.mqtt bridge
            that L2 plugins use, so it only exists while the on-device broker is
            compiled in; there is no external-broker mode. Whether it runs is
            the same adapters.mqtt_broker.enabled flag that starts the listener.

endmenu
